00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:40.373
it's important to look into the effects

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.792
on teen mental health and well-being.

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:44.919
I take this very seriously.

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:47.172
Mental health is a complex issue

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:49.466
and the existing body of scientific work

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:51.342
has not shown a causal link

00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:53.011
between using social media

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:53.928
and young people having

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:56.931
worse mental health outcomes.

